          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "The vectors ${a}_{1},$ ${a}_{2},$ ${a}_{3},$ and ${a}_{4}$ are given below. Determine whether $B={{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}$ is a basis of $\\text{Span}{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3},{a}_{4}}.$ If that is the case, find ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3},$ where ${a}_{4}={x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}.$\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{4}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
