      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-4816",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the vectors ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064318/assets/308390111ffcb243fb8612b873317302c966df288001b28c6d9b02f5946aac94.png) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064318/assets/a7df5d5b19c15a0e5f7b9d1dc93d810ca41b70c84d28c770a0d15521b14d1374.png) Find a basis of $S=\\textrm{Span}\\{\\mathbf{a}_1,\\mathbf{a}_2,\\mathbf{a}_3 \\}$ by inspection.",
