      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-6237",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the vectors ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064318/assets/ea1fe153d54f6a769e3d13177bfede1eb467525feb255fbcfd7ec88efe58b733.png) ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064318/assets/075599a7512d1105b9c6ad3acf3f4d043cb60c2aedeb8f53532045390c29f1e9.png) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064318/assets/73b2b16a58acd290d040047339b0db3c79de19c0af04303e010a2d16e75bb94b.png) Find a basis of $S=\\textrm{Span}\\{\\mathbf{a}_1,\\mathbf{a}_2,\\mathbf{a}_3 \\}.$",
